{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 65,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise waits for you, God, in Zion. shall be performed to you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，的人都等候赞美你；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，的人都等候讚美你；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "You who hear prayer, will come to you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "听祷告的啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "聽禱告的啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Sins overwhelmed me, but you atoned for our transgressions.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "罪孽胜了我；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "罪孽勝了我；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Blessed is the one whom you choose and cause to come near, that he may live in your courts. We will be filled with the goodness of your house, your holy temple.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你所拣选、使他亲近你、住在你院中的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你所揀選、使他親近你、住在你院中的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "By awesome deeds of righteousness, you answer us, of our salvation. You who are the hope of all the ends of the earth, of those who are far away on the sea.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "拯救我们的 神啊，你必以威严秉公义应允我们；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "拯救我們的上帝啊，你必以威嚴秉公義應允我們；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "By your power, you form the mountains, with strength.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他既以大能束腰，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他既以大能束腰，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "You still the roaring of the seas, the roaring of their waves, and the turmoil of the nations.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "使诸海的响声和其中波浪的响声，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "使諸海的響聲和其中波浪的響聲，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "They also who dwell in faraway places are afraid at your wonders. the morning’s dawn and the evening with songs of joy.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "住在地极的人因你的神迹惧怕；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "住在地極的人因你的神蹟懼怕；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "You visit the earth, and water it. You greatly enrich it. The river of God is full of water. You provide them grain, for so you have ordained it.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你眷顾地，降下透雨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你眷顧地，降下透雨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "You drench its furrows. You level its ridges. You soften it with showers. You bless it with a crop.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你浇透地的犁沟，润平犁脊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你澆透地的犂溝，潤平犂脊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "You crown the year with your bounty. Your carts overflow with abundance.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你以恩典为年岁的冠冕；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你以恩典為年歲的冠冕；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "The wilderness grasslands overflow. The hills are clothed with gladness.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "滴在旷野的草场上。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "滴在曠野的草場上。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "The pastures are covered with flocks. The valleys also are clothed with grain. for joy!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "草场以羊群为衣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "草場以羊群為衣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}